==Battleground==
*10 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 6~10 seconds<sup>180f~300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Lione Hippoe]] spawns as the boss.
**16 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07~4 seconds<sup>2f~120f</sup>.
**1 [[Gory Dark]] spawns.
**2 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is quite simple. Just use meatshields and a good [[:Category:Area Attack Cats|Area Attacker]] and you shouldn't have much trouble.

